uav-fire-detection
Reproduction-oriented implementation of a two-stage UAV fire-detection
pipeline (YOLOv8s detection with conditional OpenCLIP ViT-B/32 verification)
as described in Jabli, Abdellaoui and Douik, "Drone-Based Early Forest Fire
Detection Using Vision-Language Models on NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano".

